# Test Case Gap Report

> **What is this file?**
> This file documents a test case that **cannot be fully automated** due to
> missing, ambiguous, or incomplete information in the source test case.
> It must be resolved before automation can proceed.
>
> **Location:** `docs/test-case-gaps/`
> **Do NOT delete this file** until the gap is resolved and the test is implemented.

