## Blocking Gaps — Checklist

Check all that apply:

- [ ] **Missing preconditions** — test case does not specify required system state or setup steps
- [ ] **Ambiguous action steps** — step description is too vague to map to a UI interaction
- [ ] **No expected result** — one or more steps have no defined expected outcome to assert
- [ ] **Missing test data** — required input values (usernames, IDs, dates, etc.) not specified
- [ ] **UI element not described** — step references a UI element with no locator hint or description
- [ ] **Environment / dependency missing** — test requires a service, dataset, or config not available
- [ ] **Step order unclear** — steps are ambiguous in sequence or have conflicting conditions
- [ ] **Out-of-scope action** — step requires interaction outside the application (e.g., database, email server) with no test helper available
- [ ] **Incomplete negative scenario** — error condition referenced but not fully described
- [ ] **Other** — describe below

