## Next Steps After Resolution

1. Re-open the source test case in ADO and verify gaps are filled.
2. Run `#create-test` or `#ado-sync-test` Copilot prompt to implement/update the test.
3. Delete or archive this gap report file once the test is fully implemented and passing.
4. Update `runMode` from `N` to `Y` in the Excel sheet for any previously blocked rows.
